shortdesc Draw jigsaw pieces with TikZ
longdesc This is a small LaTeX package to draw jigsaw pieces with TikZ.
longdesc It is possible to draw individual pieces and adjust their
longdesc shape, create tile patterns or automatically generate complete
longdesc jigsaws.
